    },
    {
      "from": "曹休（文烈）",
      "to": "曹叡（元仲）",
      "type": "service",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9e-p4",
          "text": {
            "en": "When Cao Rui ascended the throne, Cao Xiu was advanced to County Marquis of Changping.",
            "zht": "明帝即位後，曹休進封長平侯。",
            "zhs": "明帝即位后，曹休进封长平侯。"
          },
          "title": {
            "en": "County Marquis of Changping",
            "zht": "長平侯",
            "zhs": "长平侯"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9e-p4",
          "text": {
            "en": "After defeating Shen De and receiving the surrender of Wu generals, Cao Xiu was promoted to Grand Marshal.",
            "zht": "曹休擊破審悳，又接受吳將投降後，升任大司馬。",
            "zhs": "曹休击破审德，又接受吴将投降后，升任大司马。"
          },
          "title": {
            "en": "Grand Marshal",
            "zht": "大司馬",
            "zhs": "大司马"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9e-p4",
          "text": {
            "en": "After the defeat at Shiting, Cao Xiu apologised in a memorial; Cao Rui sent Yang Ji to console him and treated him with still greater honour.",
            "zht": "石亭戰敗後，曹休上書謝罪；明帝派楊暨前去慰問，對他的禮遇和賞賜更加優厚。",
            "zhs": "石亭战败后，曹休上书谢罪；明帝派杨暨前去慰问，对他的礼遇和赏赐更加优厚。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹休（文烈）",
      "to": "曹洪（子廉）",
      "type": "colleagues",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9e-p2",
          "text": {
            "en": "Hearing that Cao Cao regarded Cao Xiu as the true commander, Cao Hong entrusted him with military affairs and followed his advice to strike Wu Lan.",
            "zht": "曹洪聽說曹操把曹休視爲實際統帥，便將軍務委託給他，並採納他的建議進擊吳蘭。",
            "zhs": "曹洪听说曹操把曹休视为实际统帅，便将军务委托给他，并采纳他的建议进击吴兰。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹休（文烈）",
      "to": "吳蘭",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9e-p2",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Xiu urged an immediate strike on Wu Lan before Shu's forces could gather, and Wu Lan was crushed.",
            "zht": "曹休主張趁敵軍尚未集結迅速攻擊吳蘭，吳蘭大敗。",
            "zhs": "曹休主张趁敌军尚未集结迅速攻击吴兰，吴兰大败。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹休（文烈）",
      "to": "張飛（益德）",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9e-p2",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Xiu read Zhang Fei's show of strength at Gushan as a bluff and predicted he would withdraw once Wu Lan was beaten; Zhang Fei duly withdrew.",
            "zht": "曹休判斷張飛在固山虛張聲勢，預料吳蘭一敗張飛就會自行退走，結果張飛果然撤退。",
            "zhs": "曹休判断张飞在固山虚张声势，预料吴兰一败张飞就会自行退走，结果张飞果然撤退。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹休（文烈）",
